 "description": "Find the existing software products that already do what an idea, a product name or a website does \u2014 the same search as risetive.com/find. Use this first when the user asks who the competitors or alternatives are, or whether something already exists. Returns a one-sentence answer (how many products do it and how big the biggest is), each competitor with its one-line description, monthly visits, Paid/Free when known, whether its site is new, and its niche, plus the niche most competitors are in. For a website it also says whether Risetive lists it. When nothing does the idea yet, the nearest products are returned separately. For one competitor's features and pricing, call risetive_get_product_profile with its domain. A search takes about 10\u201360 seconds and shares the website's per-address and daily search limits. Works without signing in (small daily allowance, at most 5 rows per list); a free Risetive account returns full results. Without an account, at most 5 searches a day.",
